降。王險城未下，故右渠之大臣成巳又反，復攻吏。左將軍使右渠子長降、相路人之子最告諭其民，誅成巳，以故遂定朝鮮，為四郡。封參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0126"}],"interpretation_note":"依原文明示殺、斬、誅、道死或棄市；未知跨段紀年不補。楊仆贖為庶人不是死亡，死亡不自動終止全部稱號。 右渠被殺後王險城仍未下，成巳之死不直接沿用前文元封三年夏。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"source_term":"誅成巳"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"成巳","kind":"person","person_id":"0hn_hdh_t8n","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian"},{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"成巳","kind":"person","person_id":"0hn_hdh_t8n","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","text":"左將軍已并兩軍，即急擊朝鮮。朝鮮相路人、相韓陰、尼谿相參、將軍王唊相與謀曰：「始欲降樓船，樓船今執，獨左將軍并將，戰益急，恐不能與，（戰）王又不肯降。」陰、唊、路人皆亡降漢。路人道死。元封三年夏，尼谿相參乃使人殺朝鮮王右渠來降。王險城未下，故右渠之大臣成巳又反，復攻吏。左將軍使右渠子長降、相路人之子最告諭其民，誅成巳，以故遂定朝鮮，為四郡。封參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"左將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_u22_s8c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"路人","kind":"person","person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"韓陰","kind":"person","person_id":"466_pwj_snr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0024","start":24,"end":28,"surface":"尼谿相參","kind":"person","person_id":"tvb_urc_goi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-1